WEBVTT

00:05.650 --> 00:07.980
[If you bring trouble, or harm people
or property beyond here, Bofurin will purge you,
no matter who you are.]
There's a sign at this town's entrance.

00:07.990 --> 00:08.960
[If you bring trouble, or harm people
or property beyond here, Bofurin will purge you,
no matter who you are.]

00:08.960 --> 00:11.280
[If you bring trouble, or harm people
or property beyond here, Bofurin will purge you,
no matter who you are.]
It was put up by very strong people.

00:11.280 --> 00:12.340
[If you bring trouble, or harm people
or property beyond here, Bofurin will purge you,
no matter who you are.]

00:12.340 --> 00:14.150
[Bofurin]
By Bofurin, Furin High boys
who fight to defend the town and its people.

00:14.150 --> 00:17.610
[Furin]
By Bofurin, Furin High boys
who fight to defend the town and its people.

00:18.330 --> 00:19.460
[Furin Senior High School]
And Sakura, who came from
out of town and enrolled in Furin,

00:19.460 --> 00:22.160
And Sakura, who came from
out of town and enrolled in Furin,

00:22.400 --> 00:26.990
saved a middle-schooler he saw
being chased while on his first patrol.

00:27.700 --> 00:32.210
But the ones chasing him were Lion's Head,

00:32.350 --> 00:35.230
a team who believes strength is everything,

00:35.590 --> 00:41.580
and they used Sakura's actions to start
an all-out war between Furin and Lion's Head.

00:42.510 --> 00:48.100
Tomiyama Choji, the leader of Lion's Head,
proposed a five-on-five team match.

00:48.820 --> 00:52.880
And if Tomiyama defeats
Furin's primo, Umemiya Hajime,

00:53.220 --> 00:57.400
Umemiya and all of Furin High would
fall under Lion's Head's control.

00:58.100 --> 01:03.980
So Sakura and the rest went to Lion's Head turf
to fight a battle they couldn't lose.

02:46.060 --> 02:48.350
Welcome, come on in!

02:49.310 --> 02:50.050
Hey.

02:50.220 --> 02:51.190
Here we are.

03:04.420 --> 03:06.190
Come on, this way!

03:07.270 --> 03:09.180
Hurry, hurry!

03:20.080 --> 03:22.990
Choji, you don't have to run.

03:31.900 --> 03:35.100
Looking around, this place is nothing but bars.

03:35.840 --> 03:38.420
Lion's Head turf is full of bars.

03:38.840 --> 03:41.520
This is the biggest bar district around.

03:42.170 --> 03:44.550
I hear it's really lively at night,

03:45.040 --> 03:47.010
but also really seedy.

03:50.420 --> 03:51.170
Wait a sec…

03:51.800 --> 03:52.840
Why are you here?

03:53.750 --> 03:54.840
You're not fighting.

03:55.150 --> 03:59.280
Wh-What do you mean, why?
I was on the scene, I'm involved!

03:59.940 --> 04:02.700
Besides, I'm also a member of Bofurin.

04:03.040 --> 04:07.470
I can't protect other people like you do,
but I want to at least protect myself.

04:08.450 --> 04:10.750
Let me… learn from you!

04:14.770 --> 04:15.690
Do whatever!

04:16.270 --> 04:18.440
You sure are quick to blush, Sakura.

04:18.500 --> 04:19.700
Cr-Cram it!

04:20.010 --> 04:21.410
No, you cram it!

04:21.820 --> 04:24.990
Dammit, take this at least a little serious!

04:25.310 --> 04:28.170
I think you could stand to relax a little, Hiragi.

04:28.520 --> 04:30.110
- I mean, hey…
- Sakura, before you fight,

04:30.160 --> 04:31.980
let me massage you into peak form!

04:31.980 --> 04:33.430
- He seems dependable.
- No way, dude!

04:33.430 --> 04:34.740
It's no trouble at all!

04:39.770 --> 04:42.250
Hey, hurry it up!

04:42.820 --> 04:43.720
This way!

04:57.970 --> 04:59.490
Once again…

05:00.400 --> 05:01.690
Welcome…

05:08.110 --> 05:10.400
…to the Lion's Head base.

05:13.810 --> 05:14.610
"Ori"?

05:25.060 --> 05:29.650
Lion's Head's base is in
a shut-down theater called Orion,

05:30.010 --> 05:32.740
but now they call it "Ori", meaning "cage".

05:36.910 --> 05:39.230
Alright, here we go!

05:42.780 --> 05:44.990
The combatants have arrived!

05:55.440 --> 05:57.010
Get to the fighting already!

05:57.110 --> 05:58.310
That's Umemiya.

05:58.380 --> 05:59.840
And Hiragi's next to him.

05:59.940 --> 06:02.000
Oi, look over here!

06:02.160 --> 06:03.400
Who all's behind 'em?

06:03.500 --> 06:04.400
Dunno.

06:07.410 --> 06:08.910
Oh, I see. I see.

06:10.510 --> 06:13.100
This is indeed a cage full of beasts.

06:13.600 --> 06:16.710
Will I be able to leave this place? Alive?

06:17.460 --> 06:19.100
Didn't you come to learn?

06:20.580 --> 06:21.560
Eyes forward.

06:27.840 --> 06:29.320
Alright, everyone!

06:31.720 --> 06:35.460
It's time for a super-duper fun set of duels!

06:37.590 --> 06:40.620
Jeez, he's whipping them into a frenzy.

06:41.920 --> 06:43.190
Listen up, guys.

06:43.360 --> 06:45.230
This became a whole thing,

06:45.490 --> 06:47.550
but the main event is me and Tomiyama.

06:48.270 --> 06:51.320
Whether you win or lose won't affect anything.

06:51.890 --> 06:53.200
So take it easy!

06:56.720 --> 06:57.690
Screw that!

06:59.080 --> 07:01.390
I don't care if it affects a damn thing,

07:01.810 --> 07:03.480
I don't plan to lose!

07:06.720 --> 07:07.820
You heard him.

07:10.770 --> 07:12.750
He's real dependable!

07:14.430 --> 07:16.430
Alright, Ume, let's go!

07:16.570 --> 07:17.780
Let's go right now!

07:18.090 --> 07:22.010
No way. You can't have the bosses go first.

07:22.070 --> 07:23.120
Whaaat?

07:25.390 --> 07:28.590
Boss, can I go first?

07:29.320 --> 07:33.940
The long-haired guy's been staring
at me, and it's pissin' me off.

07:34.590 --> 07:38.030
Ooh, Sugishita, he just asked you out.

07:39.030 --> 07:40.690
I'm cool with it.

07:48.920 --> 07:49.600
Hey!

07:53.000 --> 07:55.120
We still haven't settled our score.

07:55.800 --> 08:00.200
But I never wanna fight anyone
who loses to these losers.

08:01.470 --> 08:02.870
Hey, you listening?!

08:03.170 --> 08:04.720
I'm tellin' you not to lose!

08:10.810 --> 08:12.400
- Get him!
- Arima!

08:12.400 --> 08:14.170
- Kill him!
- Mess him up!

08:14.560 --> 08:16.290
Arima, Arima…

08:17.060 --> 08:18.070
Found him!

08:18.480 --> 08:19.600
Arima Yukinari.

08:19.820 --> 08:21.940
Apparently he's a real power-type.

08:22.340 --> 08:25.180
He once broke multiple ribs with one punch?!

08:25.310 --> 08:26.300
That's okay.

08:26.780 --> 08:28.830
Sugishita's not all that different.

08:29.120 --> 08:29.960
He'll be fine.

08:30.020 --> 08:31.060
Hey, now.

08:31.690 --> 08:33.690
Don't lump them together. It's mean.

08:41.520 --> 08:42.300
For real?

08:43.440 --> 08:46.200
Dude looks like he's about to explode.

08:54.340 --> 08:56.170
Whoa, Umemiya! What's wrong?!

09:04.720 --> 09:08.110
Don't look away during a fight, dumbass.

09:16.890 --> 09:18.040
"Mister".

09:29.940 --> 09:30.980
So. Weak.

09:38.130 --> 09:39.990
He's "Mister Umemiya" to you.

09:40.450 --> 09:41.400
Dumbass.

10:00.880 --> 10:02.270
Whoa, man, no way.

10:02.450 --> 10:03.990
Is he… for real?

10:04.500 --> 10:05.790
Arima's down!

10:06.120 --> 10:07.490
Do you know who that is?

10:08.170 --> 10:10.270
Never seen him before. He a first-year?

10:11.260 --> 10:12.060
Just…

10:12.920 --> 10:14.350
Just one hit?!

10:15.490 --> 10:16.690
No way…

10:17.180 --> 10:18.180
Arima!

10:23.840 --> 10:27.040
Wow! You're really durable!

10:34.830 --> 10:36.280
What's your name?!

10:37.330 --> 10:38.730
Fight me next!

10:38.730 --> 10:40.340
Settle down, Choji.

10:41.120 --> 10:42.890
Behave and wait your turn.

10:43.900 --> 10:46.400
Not only is he not concerned for the loser,

10:47.240 --> 10:49.530
he's praising his opponent?

10:50.990 --> 10:52.710
It was the same then, too, but…

10:53.810 --> 10:56.720
There's seriously something wrong with those guys!

10:58.080 --> 10:59.610
Yo, welcome back.

11:00.110 --> 11:02.430
Man, you were as forceful as ever.

11:02.850 --> 11:04.480
How's your jaw feeling?

11:06.530 --> 11:09.320
You've always been a sturdy one!

11:11.680 --> 11:13.610
- Sugishita's incredible.
- Dude, not where he got punched.

11:13.820 --> 11:15.620
He took that like it was nothing!

11:15.930 --> 11:17.630
Eh, that's how he is.

11:17.940 --> 11:20.690
You don't seem surprised at all.

11:20.960 --> 11:23.280
Well, I did fight him once.

11:26.120 --> 11:29.000
So you respect him, too, huh?

11:29.160 --> 11:32.670
I-I do not! I just know how sturdy he is!

11:33.590 --> 11:35.610
- What's that face for!?
- Suuure, bud.

11:35.680 --> 11:36.800
What's your deal!?

11:37.130 --> 11:40.540
- So, Kame, how would you beat long-hair?
- I'll punch you! He's just sturdy!

11:40.770 --> 11:42.820
- Kame?
- There's nothing else to it!

11:51.200 --> 11:53.410
Alright, let's do the next one! Next!

11:55.140 --> 11:56.530
Hey there, you two.

11:58.980 --> 12:00.580
Clean that up.

12:04.630 --> 12:05.790
Hurry up!

12:05.890 --> 12:06.440
On it.

12:10.780 --> 12:11.770
So heavy!

12:11.880 --> 12:14.130
No way we'll get him backstage…

12:14.930 --> 12:16.720
Let's just drop him off here.

12:19.300 --> 12:22.710
Dammit, always acted big, but look at him now.

12:23.680 --> 12:24.380
Dumbass.

12:24.520 --> 12:25.550
Eat shit.

12:26.280 --> 12:28.020
S-So cruel…

12:31.720 --> 12:32.270
Hey.

12:32.800 --> 12:34.700
Keep it down, jerks.

12:36.280 --> 12:37.050
Huh?

12:38.000 --> 12:42.080
I never want to hear you guys
say strength is everything ever again.

12:44.000 --> 12:46.240
I'm embarrassed for you.

12:46.750 --> 12:47.490
Weaklings.

12:48.860 --> 12:49.500
Huh?

12:50.390 --> 12:51.290
Sakura…

12:51.950 --> 12:53.200
Save your breath.

12:54.630 --> 12:58.680
These kids won't get it until they get hit.

12:59.810 --> 13:02.820
What, you wanna make me get it, then?

13:03.010 --> 13:03.770
Wait…!

13:03.960 --> 13:04.590
Hey.

13:05.300 --> 13:07.490
You're not his opponent.

13:09.550 --> 13:10.710
Back off.

13:12.920 --> 13:13.480
'Kay…

13:15.310 --> 13:18.980
Alright, alright! Next, next! Who's next?

13:19.500 --> 13:20.890
I'll go.

13:20.900 --> 13:22.050
Don't be silly.

13:22.200 --> 13:23.710
I'm next if we go in order.

13:23.810 --> 13:25.180
Who're you callin' silly!?

13:26.050 --> 13:27.610
Hey, cutie!

13:30.010 --> 13:33.200
You look super stressed. How about some exercise?

13:35.440 --> 13:37.900
Ooh, Numa! Go for it!

13:39.060 --> 13:41.380
- Fight, fight!
- Kill him!

13:42.190 --> 13:43.040
Sakura.

13:43.430 --> 13:44.350
What?

13:45.510 --> 13:48.120
Back when you said you came to be top dog,

13:48.480 --> 13:50.350
I thought you seemed stupid.

13:50.520 --> 13:52.390
You tryin' to pick a fight!?

13:52.500 --> 13:53.470
If so, you're on!

13:53.560 --> 13:54.620
Calm down.

13:56.650 --> 13:57.550
No, sorry.

13:58.300 --> 14:00.210
I didn't think you could back it up.

14:00.970 --> 14:04.200
But then I saw your words and actions have heart.

14:04.800 --> 14:07.520
And now I think you're cool.

14:09.600 --> 14:12.710
So I'm gonna work hard so you don't pass me by.

14:17.120 --> 14:18.830
G-Get up there already!

14:20.150 --> 14:22.680
Kanuma, get the bastard!

14:24.160 --> 14:25.470
Knock him out!

14:26.210 --> 14:28.390
So what's that guy like?

14:28.730 --> 14:30.590
Oh, you mean Kanuma?

14:30.820 --> 14:31.980
Wait a sec.

14:32.080 --> 14:33.810
No, dude, not him.

14:33.880 --> 14:35.670
Huh? You mean Suo?

14:36.660 --> 14:39.970
He was famous for his strength,
even in middle school.

14:39.970 --> 14:42.580
I can tell he's strong by looking! What else?

14:42.580 --> 14:44.250
Wait, you can tell that!?

14:44.400 --> 14:45.720
Let it go, dude!

14:45.900 --> 14:47.800
Well, about that…

14:48.570 --> 14:54.470
He's famously strong, but there's
no specifics or data on who he beat.

14:54.640 --> 14:56.560
Huh? What's that about?

14:57.020 --> 15:00.020
I've definitely heard his name a lot,

15:00.330 --> 15:03.640
but nothing else. We went to different schools.

15:04.290 --> 15:07.260
I didn't know much about Suo, myself,

15:07.930 --> 15:09.210
until I met him.

15:12.290 --> 15:14.470
I saw he's a nice guy.

15:16.500 --> 15:19.200
It's you guys' fault that Arima is…

15:19.530 --> 15:22.470
What's this? You do get mad
for your friends' sake?

15:23.470 --> 15:25.400
That's different from before.

15:25.740 --> 15:26.640
I…

15:27.060 --> 15:29.730
was always with Arima!

15:30.170 --> 15:32.000
My bro got taken out.

15:32.420 --> 15:34.410
How could I not get mad?!

15:36.670 --> 15:39.620
If you only make a fuss when you're the victim,

15:40.490 --> 15:42.610
then you're still a petulant kid.

15:44.110 --> 15:46.280
A "nice guy", huh?

15:47.010 --> 15:50.030
It must have been hawd on you, cutie.

15:51.320 --> 15:54.090
Is that a face a nice guy would make?

16:02.330 --> 16:06.800
Tantrums are only cute before elementary school.

16:07.880 --> 16:08.640
So…

16:09.710 --> 16:12.830
How about you climb
the stairs to adulthood with me?

16:18.450 --> 16:20.890
Wh-What just happened?

16:22.950 --> 16:24.560
He got behind me in a flash…

16:25.270 --> 16:27.580
His movements were reactive…

16:28.270 --> 16:31.600
That means I just gotta punch
so fast he can't dodge!

16:36.970 --> 16:38.230
What a big fall.

16:42.250 --> 16:43.120
You bastard!

16:49.360 --> 16:50.490
A question for you.

16:51.800 --> 16:55.700
What do you think makes somebody an adult?

16:58.110 --> 17:01.290
How about you climb
the stairs to adulthood with me?

17:04.280 --> 17:07.480
Stop saying weird shit!

17:10.310 --> 17:14.370
Wh-Whoa… It looks like the other guy's
just falling on his own.

17:17.210 --> 17:18.440
Dumbass!

17:18.540 --> 17:19.880
Take this seriously!

17:19.930 --> 17:21.370
Quit playin' around!

17:21.720 --> 17:23.510
Screw you, Kanuma!

17:23.690 --> 17:25.700
You think this is a joke?!

17:27.610 --> 17:29.100
You don't even know…

17:30.250 --> 17:32.490
I'm not playing…!

17:32.930 --> 17:36.680
I push, I pull, I grab, but I end up
on the floor in an instant!

17:37.450 --> 17:40.970
If you think it's so easy, you try fighting him!

17:43.280 --> 17:45.600
So he wasn't just a nice guy!

17:45.980 --> 17:47.830
He's not nice at all.

17:48.320 --> 17:50.190
Dude's rotten to the core.

17:50.380 --> 17:50.940
Bwuh?

17:51.470 --> 17:55.140
He won't let weaker guys die or shine.
He makes a show of 'em,

17:55.710 --> 17:58.480
and strings them along forever.

18:04.090 --> 18:06.460
If I was that guy, I'd rather die.

18:06.580 --> 18:08.300
I-I see…

18:08.410 --> 18:10.290
It'd go different for me, though.

18:10.620 --> 18:12.180
This certainly is brutal.

18:13.230 --> 18:18.270
Well, I'm sure he had his own thoughts
after seeing Lion's Head.

18:18.970 --> 18:21.580
Didn't expect him to get so emotional.

18:22.090 --> 18:24.410
Well, hey, I think we know why.

18:24.980 --> 18:28.450
The guy he was with drew them out.

18:29.180 --> 18:30.320
Now you mention it…

18:30.870 --> 18:31.990
I'm gonna work hard.

18:33.300 --> 18:33.860
Hey.

18:34.680 --> 18:35.470
What?

18:37.330 --> 18:40.380
What d'you think it'd take
to make him fight for reals?

18:40.420 --> 18:41.700
Huh? Why?

18:47.910 --> 18:48.790
Bastard!

18:54.020 --> 18:54.840
You…!

19:13.550 --> 19:15.380
Stand up already!

19:15.520 --> 19:17.870
You makin' fun of us, Kanuma?!

19:18.060 --> 19:20.340
You call this a fight?!

19:32.080 --> 19:33.470
N-No way…

19:35.590 --> 19:36.770
At this rate…

19:41.380 --> 19:42.260
Have you…

19:42.910 --> 19:44.530
figured out the answer yet?

19:45.410 --> 19:47.110
I know what you're thinking…

19:47.900 --> 19:50.320
…ible. Im… Im…

19:51.590 --> 19:52.330
…ssible…

19:53.310 --> 19:55.910
Impossible! Impossible!

19:57.780 --> 20:02.370
That's straight-up impossible!

20:09.450 --> 20:13.690
Here's what you're thinking. Tell me if I'm right.

20:15.220 --> 20:19.770
You're imagining yourself
in the position of a guy you made fun of.

20:21.350 --> 20:23.170
And that's the answer.

20:23.740 --> 20:26.100
What you need to become an adult.

20:27.290 --> 20:28.440
Imagination.

20:37.340 --> 20:38.050
Now…

20:39.130 --> 20:40.900
You have it, so you're one of us!

20:41.300 --> 20:43.050
Let's move on before you forget.

20:44.690 --> 20:49.820
What do you think you need to do
to strengthen your imagination?

20:51.010 --> 20:51.880
The answer is…

20:53.010 --> 20:55.300
Making what you imagined real.

21:00.850 --> 21:01.600
W-Wait!

21:01.600 --> 21:02.800
That's enough.

21:04.180 --> 21:05.450
It's over.

21:06.510 --> 21:09.090
Sorry, Patchy, but can you get down?

21:10.300 --> 21:12.130
Huh? Is it over?

21:13.350 --> 21:16.200
N-No, wait… why…?

21:16.290 --> 21:19.800
Don't shame us any more.

21:20.290 --> 21:20.870
Actually…

21:21.660 --> 21:23.340
There's no shame.

21:24.960 --> 21:26.730
You're not one of us anymore.

21:37.780 --> 21:42.350
Becoming an adult means
being considerate of others.

21:43.490 --> 21:45.910
That takes imagination and experience.

21:47.400 --> 21:48.220
Good for you.

21:49.630 --> 21:52.970
You've climbed your first step.

21:56.960 --> 21:59.960
[#05: A Kind Man]

23:30.400 --> 23:34.400
Lion's Head's base sure has an atmosphere to it…

23:34.560 --> 23:38.140
This is… a shut-down theater, huh?

23:39.070 --> 23:39.620
Ah…!

23:39.960 --> 23:42.830
[The Shark, Shark & Shark, Movie of Shark]
I've heard of the shark movie on this poster!

23:42.830 --> 23:43.610
[The Shark, Shark & Shark, Movie of Shark]

23:43.610 --> 23:46.400
[The Shark, Shark & Shark, Movie of Shark]
Wait… This one's also a shark movie.

23:46.400 --> 23:47.480
[The Shark, Shark & Shark, Movie of Shark]

23:47.480 --> 23:49.290
[The Shark, Shark & Shark, Movie of Shark]
And this one, too…

23:49.290 --> 23:50.130
[The Shark, Shark & Shark, Movie of Shark]

23:50.130 --> 23:52.130
[The Shark, Shark & Shark, Movie of Shark]
Whoa, this, too?

23:52.130 --> 23:52.650
[The Shark, Shark & Shark, Movie of Shark]

23:52.650 --> 23:53.830
[The Shark, Shark & Shark, Movie of Shark]
- It's all sharks…

23:53.830 --> 23:56.180
[The Shark, Shark & Shark, Movie of Shark]

23:56.180 --> 23:58.680
[The Shark, Shark & Shark, Movie of Shark]
I think I know why it shut down.

23:58.680 --> 24:00.680
[The Shark, Shark & Shark, Movie of Shark]
